  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np4:2.2.13": "Sp 1.506: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Aññātikāya vematiko aññātikāya ñātikasaññīti imānipi padāni vuttānaṁyeva tiṇṇaṁ catukkānaṁ vasena vitthārato veditabbāni</i>, “‘If she is unrelated, but he is unsure of it; if she is unrelated, but he perceives her as related’: these sentences should be understood in detail just as the stated three tetrads (above).” ",
